---
// src/components/ExperienceSection.astro
// Concrete timeline of achievements, internships, and production deployments
---

<section id="experience" class="section-padding experience-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header reveal-on-scroll">
      <span class="section-tag">
        <span class="lang-id">Pengalaman & Prestasi</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Experience & Milestones</span>
      </span>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        <span class="lang-id">Rekam Jejak Teknis & Profesional</span>
        <span class="lang-en">Technical & Professional Track Record</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        <span class="lang-id">
          Kilas balik pengalaman kompetisi tingkat provinsi, magang industri, dan implementasi sistem skala nyata.
        </span>
        <span class="lang-en">
          A verifiable record of provincial-level competitions, industrial internships, and real-world system implementations.
        </span>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="timeline-container">
      <!-- Item 1: LKS 2026 -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-1">
        <div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
          <div class="timeline-dot gold"></div>
          <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card timeline-card highlight-border">
          <div class="timeline-card-header">
            <div>
              <span class="timeline-period font-mono">2026</span>
              <h3 class="timeline-role">
                <span class="lang-id">Juara 1 LKS IT Network System Administration Purworejo</span>
                <span class="lang-en">1st Place LKS IT Network System Administration Purworejo</span>
              </h3>
              <span class="timeline-org">LKS SMK Kabupaten Purworejo & Dinas Pendidikan Jawa Tengah</span>
            </div>
            <span class="award-pill">
              <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <circle cx="12" cy="8" r="6"></circle>
                <path d="M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11"></path>
              </svg>
              <span>Gold Medalist</span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <p class="timeline-desc">
            <span class="lang-id">
              Meraih peringkat pertama pada seleksi tingkat kabupaten dan mewakili Purworejo di ajang <strong>LKS SMK Tingkat Provinsi Jawa Tengah ke-XXXIV</strong>. Menguasai modul konfigurasi Router Cisco, switching VLAN, manajemen jaringan MikroTik, dan setup server Debian/Windows dalam batasan waktu kompetisi ketat.
            </span>
            <span class="lang-en">
              Awarded 1st place in the regency selection and represented Purworejo at the <strong>34th Central Java Provincial Vocational Skills Competition (LKS)</strong>. Successfully completed timed modules in Cisco router configuration, VLAN switching, MikroTik administration, and Debian/Windows server deployment.
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 2: PERISAI Temon Projects -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-2">
        <div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card timeline-card">
          <div class="timeline-card-header">
            <div>
              <span class="timeline-period font-mono">2024 — 2026</span>
              <h3 class="timeline-role">
                <span class="lang-id">Lead Developer — Platform PERISAI & PERISAI AYOM</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Lead Developer — PERISAI & PERISAI AYOM Platforms</span>
              </h3>
              <span class="timeline-org">Pemerintah Kapanewon Temon, Kulon Progo</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="timeline-desc">
            <span class="lang-id">
              Merancang dan mengimplementasikan sistem pengaduan publik terpadu dan pelaporan perlindungan perempuan & anak. Mengintegrasikan <strong>Google Gemini 2.0 Flash</strong> untuk auto-triage laporan dalam 1–3 detik, notifikasi email resi, pemetaan GIS 15 Kalurahan, dan Row Level Security (RLS) PostgreSQL.
            </span>
            <span class="lang-en">
              Architected and deployed integrated public complaint and anonymous reporting platforms. Integrated <strong>Google Gemini 2.0 Flash</strong> for 1–3 second auto-triage, instant email dispatch, 15-village GIS mapping, and Supabase PostgreSQL Row Level Security (RLS).
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 3: PKL IMC Computer -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-3">
        <div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card timeline-card">
          <div class="timeline-card-header">
            <div>
              <span class="timeline-period font-mono">2025</span>
              <h3 class="timeline-role">
                <span class="lang-id">Teknisi Jaringan & Hardware (PKL)</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Network & Hardware Technician (Internship)</span>
              </h3>
              <span class="timeline-org">Izzan Mediatek Computindo (IMC Computer)</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="timeline-desc">
            <span class="lang-id">
              Menangani perakitan unit komputer klien, diagnostik kerusakan komponen hardware, instalasi dan optimalisasi sistem operasi, serta penarikan kabel dan konfigurasi jaringan LAN lokal untuk perkantoran dan retail.
            </span>
            <span class="lang-en">
              Handled client PC assemblies, hardware diagnostics, OS installation and optimization, as well as Ethernet cabling and local LAN configurations for office and retail environments.
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Item 4: PKL UPTD BLK Kebumen -->
      <div class="timeline-item reveal-on-scroll reveal-delay-4">
        <div class="timeline-dot-wrapper">
          <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
          <div class="timeline-line hidden-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="editorial-card timeline-card">
          <div class="timeline-card-header">
            <div>
              <span class="timeline-period font-mono">2025</span>
              <h3 class="timeline-role">
                <span class="lang-id">Teknisi Laboratorium Komputer (PKL)</span>
                <span class="lang-en">Computer Lab Technician (Internship)</span>
              </h3>
              <span class="timeline-org">UPTD Balai Latihan Kerja (BLK) Dinas Tenaga Kerja Kab. Kebumen</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="timeline-desc">
            <span class="lang-id">
              Melakukan pemeliharaan rutin laboratorium komputer pelatihan, instalasi software pelatihan vokasi, pengawasan kestabilan koneksi internet gedung, dan troubleshooting perangkat jaringan kerja.
            </span>
            <span class="lang-en">
              Conducted regular maintenance of training computer laboratories, deployed vocational training software, monitored institutional internet connection stability, and troubleshot network devices.
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .experience-section {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .timeline-container {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .timeline-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: clamp(14px, 3vw, 24px);
  }

  .timeline-dot-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .timeline-dot {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-foreground);
    border: 3px solid var(--bg-main);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--color-border);
    margin-top: 24px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .timeline-dot.gold {
    background: #EAB308;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);
  }

  .timeline-line {
    width: 2px;
    flex: 1;
    background: var(--color-border);
    margin: 6px 0;
  }

  .hidden-line {
    display: none;
  }

  .timeline-card {
    flex: 1;
    padding: clamp(18px, 3vw, 26px);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .highlight-border {
    border-color: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.4);
  }

  .timeline-card-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .timeline-period {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .timeline-role {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .timeline-org {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-subtle);
    display: block;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .award-pill {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 5px;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.12);
    color: #CA8A04;
    border: 1px solid rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.3);
  }

  .timeline-desc {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .timeline-desc strong {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }
</style>
